WEBVTT

00:09.690 --> 00:11.900
I can follow anywhere you go.

00:13.070 --> 00:14.820
Call me "Onee-sama"!

00:16.320 --> 00:21.190
Okay! I got myself a
super-platinum ticket to a classical concert!

00:21.190 --> 00:22.460
Wow!

00:22.460 --> 00:26.790
But we aren't at the point of
going on dates alone yet...

00:26.800 --> 00:28.850
You know how to deal with that...

00:28.850 --> 00:32.540
Just touch them, and that'll be that!

00:32.540 --> 00:34.050
I can't do that.

00:34.690 --> 00:36.050
Because I...

00:41.890 --> 00:43.810
I haven't done anything.

00:43.810 --> 00:45.370
Onee-sama?

00:50.170 --> 00:51.810
Don't worry about it.

00:51.810 --> 00:54.950
I only do that later.

00:57.200 --> 00:59.980
Snack time!

01:09.710 --> 01:11.210
Wake up!

01:13.240 --> 01:14.770
This mark...

01:15.400 --> 01:17.090
It's hers.

01:17.700 --> 01:21.460
I'm not letting her
have my little sisters!

01:22.100 --> 01:24.890
My heart throbs as I really do love you!

01:33.440 --> 01:38.490
These fifteen secrets in my head are written in letters, tucked away in my uniform.

01:38.490 --> 01:44.080
When you keep on making circles around me, in the middle of the launch of your image,

01:44.910 --> 01:49.630
you treat me kindly even with your mean look and puffed cheeks.

01:49.630 --> 01:55.300
For your first heart-throbbing, I'm sure you'll find it tremendous!

01:55.840 --> 01:58.760
Your voice will escape daringly!

01:58.760 --> 02:01.640
What you want to make your heart tingle, tell me!

02:01.640 --> 02:04.560
Quick! Let me! Where do you want what?! Seriously, you're terrible!

02:04.560 --> 02:06.560
These wild ideas have all detonated!

02:06.560 --> 02:09.400
I want to try and swallow more

02:09.400 --> 02:12.570
I want you to pet me more

02:12.570 --> 02:15.400
What kind of flavor is your heart?

02:15.400 --> 02:18.280
Someday, I'll be sure to grasp a hold of what's real

02:18.280 --> 02:20.570
I want to embrace you more

02:20.570 --> 02:23.780
Will you secretly let me see you?

02:23.830 --> 02:26.660
I can't get enough of this dream I'm having!

02:26.660 --> 02:32.040
Be it my heart or also my body, I'll hand them over since it's you.

02:29.870 --> 02:34.630
My heart throbs as I really do love you! (Look here!)

02:32.710 --> 02:37.380
My heart throbs as I really do love you! (Look here!)

02:35.500 --> 02:40.800
My heart throbs as I really do love you!

02:52.610 --> 02:56.400
"Beyond Friends with Benefits"

03:01.780 --> 03:04.890
So great... Just wonderful!

03:04.890 --> 03:08.160
I can feel a masterpiece coming on.

03:08.720 --> 03:10.160
I've settled on you.

03:11.690 --> 03:13.170
U-Um...

03:13.170 --> 03:15.670
Good morning, Fukune-chan.

03:16.560 --> 03:18.830
I should have guessed you'd
talk to Fukune-chan.

03:18.830 --> 03:21.220
Everyone's talking about
you, Botan-senpai.

03:21.220 --> 03:22.850
You do have good taste...

03:22.850 --> 03:24.650
You're quite famous yourself.

03:24.650 --> 03:28.560
Everyone's talking about the silly
freshman whom her classmates call "Onee-sama."

03:28.570 --> 03:30.710
Oh, are they?

03:30.710 --> 03:34.190
So you knew that was my
little sister last night.

03:34.190 --> 03:40.330
That's not your little sister anymore,
but one of my paintings.

03:40.330 --> 03:44.570
I'll have to thank you properly.

03:44.570 --> 03:46.080
I definitely will!

03:48.440 --> 03:50.580
I'll look forward to it.

03:50.580 --> 03:54.930
What has gotten into Ran this morning?

03:54.930 --> 03:57.210
She's talking to Beni Botan-senpai.

03:57.640 --> 03:59.080
Beni Botan?

03:59.080 --> 04:01.720
I think I just heard that name
somewhere recently...

04:02.840 --> 04:07.530
Taketo-san, have you heard of
the painted uniform incident?

04:07.530 --> 04:10.560
<i>Painted uniform incident?</i>

04:15.300 --> 04:19.900
A world-famous genius
of avant-garde art!

04:19.900 --> 04:23.020
Th-That's Botan-senpai?

04:23.520 --> 04:27.620
I've heard she'll make any motif
she likes into art, no matter what.

04:27.960 --> 04:29.360
Into art...

04:30.780 --> 04:34.900
I wish she'd see the difference between
being passionate and out of control.

04:34.900 --> 04:36.470
Yeah.

04:36.470 --> 04:40.150
She should come up with
a better use for that energy.

04:40.150 --> 04:42.630
C-Come...

04:43.060 --> 04:47.050
Not you too... People are watching...

04:47.450 --> 04:48.740
We're in public.

04:48.740 --> 04:50.680
Say it! Now! Loudly!

04:52.480 --> 04:55.980
3.1415926...

05:04.740 --> 05:06.830
<i>Narukara-san is alone.</i>

05:06.830 --> 05:09.660
What are you staring at, ero-writer?

05:11.070 --> 05:12.630
What?

05:13.160 --> 05:15.000
It isn't your problem, is it?

05:15.000 --> 05:17.610
First Botan-senpai, and now you...

05:17.610 --> 05:22.210
Why does Fukune-chan attract
all these weirdos?

05:22.210 --> 05:25.760
Wh-What? Botan-senpai? Seriously?

05:25.760 --> 05:27.850
I won't let either of you touch her!

05:27.850 --> 05:30.640
Not her... Not an ero-writer, like you!

05:35.830 --> 05:38.580
Narukara Fukune-san, of class 1-3,

05:38.580 --> 05:42.170
the Genius Cultural Activities Committee
is looking for you.

05:42.170 --> 05:44.150
Please report to the teachers' office.

05:44.150 --> 05:46.430
She's going...

05:46.430 --> 05:50.070
The Genius Cultural
Activities Committee?

05:50.070 --> 05:52.610
I've never heard of it before.

05:52.610 --> 05:55.270
I'm sure some weirdo founded it.

05:55.270 --> 05:57.470
This is Inspiration Academy, after all.

06:02.340 --> 06:04.510
I knew it!

06:05.260 --> 06:06.450
What?

06:06.930 --> 06:11.680
The Prodigy Activities
and Business Committee

06:06.930 --> 06:11.680


06:06.930 --> 06:11.680
Ban
<Agamori

06:06.930 --> 06:11.680
Beni Botan

06:06.930 --> 06:11.680
Asaji
Rittou>

06:06.930 --> 06:11.680
Beni Botan (Beni Botan)

06:06.930 --> 06:11.680
Sengakuen High Class Academy, Third Year of Junior High.

06:06.930 --> 06:11.680
Awarded at the twenty-ninth Worldwide Modern Art

06:06.930 --> 06:11.680
Competition with special honors.

06:06.930 --> 06:11.680
Aside from school, involved in many student-oriented

06:06.930 --> 06:11.680
fine art activities.

06:06.930 --> 06:11.680
Genius Cultural Activities Committee

06:06.930 --> 06:11.680
Beni Botan

06:07.290 --> 06:09.440
Beni Botan is president
of that committee...

06:09.440 --> 06:11.680
She's set a trap for Fukune-chan!

06:11.680 --> 06:13.190
I won't allow it!

06:13.850 --> 06:14.810
Wait!

06:15.220 --> 06:16.320
I'll go, too.

06:16.320 --> 06:18.290
Why are you following me?

06:18.290 --> 06:20.810
Because I'm worried about Narukara-san.

06:21.850 --> 06:23.530
Imagining you're her knight in
shining armor or something?

06:23.530 --> 06:26.070
Don't be ridiculous, ero-writer!

06:26.070 --> 06:30.070
Th-That isn't important right now.

06:31.650 --> 06:34.370
You don't think Fukune-chan would
want nothing to do with you?

06:35.810 --> 06:38.170
I'll protect her myself.

06:38.170 --> 06:39.490
Don't get in my way!

06:41.460 --> 06:42.570
I...

06:44.940 --> 06:47.400
It's coming... It's coming.

06:48.370 --> 06:52.220
Um, what's this special event?

06:52.220 --> 06:55.350
I already told you...

06:55.350 --> 07:01.860
I plan to hold a big exhibition for all the
Inspiration Academy artistic geniuses.

07:01.860 --> 07:07.360
So I need a really good,
new piece to be at its center.

07:07.830 --> 07:10.240
You'll help me, right? Right?

07:10.650 --> 07:12.990
But my practice...

07:12.990 --> 07:15.590
Yes, I know.

07:15.590 --> 07:18.870
But first, let me get started.

07:24.810 --> 07:26.930
The world is empty, except for us.

07:26.930 --> 07:29.050
No one can bother us.

07:29.600 --> 07:31.630
Let's take our time and have fun...

07:31.630 --> 07:34.780
I'm sorry, Onee-sama.
I couldn't find her.

07:34.780 --> 07:37.140
It looks like her studio's
location is top-secret.

07:37.140 --> 07:39.670
Just you wait, senpai!

07:43.760 --> 07:46.080
Resistance is futile.

07:46.080 --> 07:48.400
Expose everything to me.

07:48.400 --> 07:51.150
Call me "Onee-sama"!

07:58.290 --> 08:01.820
At that instant, forty-five
satellites were hacked,

08:01.820 --> 08:04.960
including several military satellites
belonging to superpowers.

08:05.570 --> 08:11.370
Simultaneously, all the school security cameras
fell under Musen Ran's control.

08:18.970 --> 08:20.890
Inspiration Academy classrooms, check.

08:21.290 --> 08:22.600
Girls' dorms, check.

08:22.600 --> 08:23.480
Check.

08:23.480 --> 08:24.350
Check.

08:24.350 --> 08:25.230
Check...

08:25.230 --> 08:26.480
Check!

08:27.050 --> 08:30.420
I don't see her on any of the cameras...

08:30.420 --> 08:33.740
Which means she's elsewhere!

08:34.810 --> 08:37.640
<i>I wonder what Botan-senpai's
doing right now...</i>

08:43.330 --> 08:45.080
Now it's your turn.

08:49.050 --> 08:51.590
I can't waste time thinking about it!

08:54.410 --> 08:58.680
I'd prefer you not use my spy cameras
for stuff like this.

08:58.680 --> 09:02.930
Senpai! Don't try telling me you've forgotten
what you did to Fukune-chan.

09:02.930 --> 09:08.060
If you don't stop complaining, you'll get
a big serving of the Musen Ran viruses

09:08.060 --> 09:10.140
that took out the Department of Defense!

09:10.140 --> 09:13.030
Right, right. I get it...

09:13.730 --> 09:16.360
C-Clarinet...

09:16.920 --> 09:19.530
Now, let's get started.

09:23.540 --> 09:26.290
That's enough, Botan-senpai.

09:26.290 --> 09:30.960
No way... How'd she find
my studio so easily?

09:30.960 --> 09:33.400
Pretty clever...

09:33.400 --> 09:37.850
Hiding your underground studio's entrance
in an abandoned incinerator.

09:37.850 --> 09:39.780
It's a great hideout...

09:39.780 --> 09:42.680
Perfect for having
some fun with someone.

09:42.680 --> 09:44.390
What do you mean, fun?

09:44.390 --> 09:47.320
You dragged her here, not even asking
what she thought about it.

09:47.320 --> 09:49.480
She won't be having any fun at all!

09:49.960 --> 09:52.800
Oh, my! Is that the problem?

09:52.800 --> 09:54.190
Of course it is!

09:54.190 --> 09:57.530
Gentle... Fun... And elegant.

09:57.530 --> 10:00.210
That's how an onee-sama should be!

10:01.490 --> 10:05.770
Then what if someone were
to take her tomorrow?

10:05.770 --> 10:07.750
Would you be okay with that?

10:07.750 --> 10:10.050
Wh-What?

10:10.050 --> 10:13.510
The only thing I believe in is
the passion I feel, in the moment.

10:13.510 --> 10:15.920
Truth exists solely in the present.

10:17.360 --> 10:21.800
We're different. I don't try and excuse
the things of which I am bad.

10:22.860 --> 10:23.810
Bad?!

10:23.810 --> 10:28.980
That's right. I just said that you're bad
at dealing with girls...

10:28.980 --> 10:32.800
Y-You're saying I'm bad with girls?

10:32.800 --> 10:34.900
I'll never forgive you!

10:34.900 --> 10:39.290
I see. Then you'll prove it?

10:41.640 --> 10:42.980
And now...

10:42.980 --> 10:44.520
An anything goes one-round match

10:44.520 --> 10:47.160
to determine possession
of Narukara Fukune.

10:47.160 --> 10:49.190
In the blue corner,

10:49.190 --> 10:53.290
Class 3-2, Beni Botan!

10:53.790 --> 10:55.190
In the red corner,

10:55.190 --> 10:59.550
Class 1-3, Musen Ran!

11:01.650 --> 11:03.770
I, Kiya Star, will provide commentary.

11:03.550 --> 11:09.180
Genius Analyst

11:03.550 --> 11:09.180
Mei Choushi

11:03.770 --> 11:08.100
Analysis will be provided by the
genius analyst, Mei Choushi.

11:08.100 --> 11:09.190
Hi, everyone.

11:33.150 --> 11:35.420
I knew this would get crazy.

11:37.840 --> 11:40.420
Ran starts by turning her back
on her opponent?

11:40.420 --> 11:43.640
It'll be interesting to see what
happens here. Let's watch.

11:46.140 --> 11:48.140
She smiled!

11:52.310 --> 11:54.440
And she beckoned!

11:54.930 --> 11:57.460
Making a younger sister uneasy,
by facing away in silence.

11:57.460 --> 12:00.030
Then eliminating that discomfort,
by turning with a smile.

12:00.030 --> 12:03.600
An onee-sama combo, relying on
a beckoning to double the joy.

12:04.620 --> 12:08.350
All Ran's sisters have fallen over!

12:08.350 --> 12:09.620
Quite effective.

12:12.370 --> 12:15.380
Botan walks unsteadily toward her.

12:15.380 --> 12:18.160
Will she go for a passionate embrace?

12:18.160 --> 12:20.340
Or will she go ahead and steal a kiss?

12:20.340 --> 12:21.660
Let's find out.

12:25.640 --> 12:28.930
You caught me a little, but...

12:30.430 --> 12:33.600
I prefer to do things more directly.

12:33.600 --> 12:36.610
What's that? Are you shooting lasers
at me or something?

12:47.850 --> 12:49.830
N-No...

12:49.830 --> 12:52.290
A single glance is all it takes.

12:53.460 --> 12:55.210
Ran, snap out of it!

12:56.480 --> 12:58.510
Now, let's get started.

13:03.050 --> 13:05.930
I told you, I like taking
the direct approach!

13:08.300 --> 13:10.220
This is much faster.

13:14.270 --> 13:17.350
Botan counterattacks
with a wild breast grab.

13:17.350 --> 13:19.720
Ran's technique has been
completely countered!

13:19.720 --> 13:21.150
This will be hard to escape.

13:21.150 --> 13:24.450
Ran's technique relies heavily
on a set pattern...

13:24.450 --> 13:27.660
A look, followed by a gesture,
followed by an embrace.

13:27.660 --> 13:31.160
Botan's response is simply
to go after her physically.

13:36.120 --> 13:39.290
Look! Botan starts running!

13:41.360 --> 13:42.460
Why, you...

13:53.530 --> 13:55.850
See? Do you understand now?

14:06.850 --> 14:09.320
For all your talk of feelings,

14:09.730 --> 14:12.480
ultimately, you just can't do it.

14:13.830 --> 14:16.470
You feel good, don't you?

14:21.320 --> 14:23.960
Even with me.

14:27.870 --> 14:30.590
Now then, let's finish this.

14:45.650 --> 14:48.060
There it is! Her
breast-painting technique!

14:48.060 --> 14:50.330
Art and attack, all in one.

14:50.330 --> 14:51.410
She really is a genius.

15:01.260 --> 15:02.580
Ran!

15:14.810 --> 15:17.080
Stupid, stupid, stupid. What are you doing?!

15:14.810 --> 15:18.180
I guess that's the match.

15:17.080 --> 15:18.180
What?!

15:19.130 --> 15:21.390
Wh-What are you doing here?

15:21.390 --> 15:24.290
No one asked you for help!

15:24.290 --> 15:25.680
I know that!

15:25.680 --> 15:29.340
But at this rate, Narukara-san will be turned
into one of her artworks, right?

15:29.340 --> 15:30.360
Shut up!

15:31.300 --> 15:32.450
This time,

15:32.450 --> 15:34.910
I'll protect her.

15:40.540 --> 15:42.750
Ran, I have an idea.

15:43.870 --> 15:48.270
As a porno writer, I'm
very aroused by her.

15:48.270 --> 15:51.170
I'll hit her with all that libido.

15:52.260 --> 15:54.390
It should give you an opening, at least.

15:56.500 --> 15:59.870
Will you let me help
you? Just this once...

15:59.870 --> 16:01.730
To protect Narukara-san.

16:02.130 --> 16:03.980
B-But...

16:03.980 --> 16:05.730
I...

16:06.030 --> 16:06.730
Ran!

16:08.110 --> 16:10.670
Oh, my! Botan has dragged
Narukara-san into the ring,

16:10.670 --> 16:13.740
not waiting for the match to end!

16:16.680 --> 16:18.740
Now, let's begin.

16:22.910 --> 16:25.040
Narukara-san is waiting.

16:27.430 --> 16:29.480
Don't screw this up, or else!

16:29.480 --> 16:30.710
Same to you.

16:32.630 --> 16:34.930
C-Clarinet...

16:40.070 --> 16:41.390
That's far enough.

16:47.730 --> 16:50.320
Oh, you're still standing?

16:50.320 --> 16:55.070
But I doubt you can do anything,
with your body in that state.

16:55.550 --> 16:57.020
Ran returned!

16:57.020 --> 16:58.740
Could the match not be decided?

17:01.910 --> 17:04.290
See? I knew it.

17:04.290 --> 17:06.480
Ran is down!

17:06.480 --> 17:08.920
Is she finally out?

17:08.920 --> 17:11.510
Hey! Uh...

17:11.510 --> 17:14.260
That's right. The match is over.

17:14.260 --> 17:18.170
But an artist could never
be satisfied by this alone.

17:18.170 --> 17:20.490
Only the finest canvas could show off

17:20.490 --> 17:22.720
the image nurtured within her mind.

17:23.380 --> 17:26.480
The finest canvas?

17:26.480 --> 17:27.980
That's you!

17:27.980 --> 17:30.770
Yes, the artist's own body!

17:32.710 --> 17:34.190
I...

17:34.870 --> 17:36.280
...am the canvas?

17:50.490 --> 17:54.510
First, she tasted the
ripe, swelling oranges.

17:55.540 --> 17:59.510
Her body hardened at the thought
of glistening strawberries,

17:59.520 --> 18:00.760
plucked by their tips.

18:03.560 --> 18:05.510
A heart-shaped peach...

18:06.020 --> 18:08.080
And at the center of this fruit,

18:08.080 --> 18:11.940
a spring of hot, flowing turpentine.

18:14.190 --> 18:15.660
She draws.

18:15.660 --> 18:17.820
And she is drawn on...

18:17.820 --> 18:20.890
An eternal Ouroboros of creation.

18:21.470 --> 18:25.730
Giving herself over, to a state of ecstasy
she had never before known,

18:25.730 --> 18:26.710
the artist forgot all else.

18:28.480 --> 18:30.960
More! More...

18:32.420 --> 18:33.710
Now, Ran!

18:36.660 --> 18:37.470
No!

18:39.180 --> 18:40.470
I'll show you!

18:40.470 --> 18:42.470
An onee-sama...

18:44.470 --> 18:46.300
Gazes into your eyes.

18:48.490 --> 18:50.100
Takes your hand.

18:51.950 --> 18:54.150
<i>H-Her attack...</i>

18:57.810 --> 18:59.770
Lends you her shoulder.

19:01.260 --> 19:03.530
<i>I-I can't stop!</i>

19:03.530 --> 19:05.700
Looks into your heart...

19:16.770 --> 19:18.090
And in the end,

19:19.000 --> 19:20.970
does this!

19:25.100 --> 19:28.370
There it is! The genius programmer
Ran is showing her true power...

19:28.370 --> 19:31.100
A speedy rain of gentle caresses!

19:32.340 --> 19:34.660
It's... It's good.

19:37.940 --> 19:40.450
Call me "Onee-sama"!

19:53.710 --> 19:55.940
It isn't that I can't do it.

19:55.940 --> 19:59.690
I just don't go as far
as I can, senpai.

20:00.470 --> 20:01.870
She's down!

20:01.870 --> 20:03.720
Botan has lost the match!

20:03.720 --> 20:09.350
Ran pretended to go down splendidly,
and Botan lowered her guard.

20:09.350 --> 20:13.350
No, Botan would have normally
seen through that feint.

20:13.350 --> 20:17.910
Had she not been utterly
entranced by that reading...

20:18.950 --> 20:20.360
I-I did it...

20:29.370 --> 20:32.620
Are you okay? Does it hurt anywhere?

20:35.670 --> 20:38.290
Wh-Where's Botan-senpai?

20:39.040 --> 20:40.800
Forget about her.

20:40.810 --> 20:44.300
She'll be preoccupied
for a while, I'm sure!

20:47.640 --> 20:50.310
Musen-san, did you save me?

20:53.210 --> 20:54.240
Thank y—

20:55.730 --> 20:58.200
Hey, Fukune-chan...

20:58.610 --> 21:02.020
My head is spinning.

21:02.020 --> 21:05.610
That was a really thick nosebleed...

21:08.120 --> 21:09.560
Um...

21:09.560 --> 21:12.540
N-N-Nar... Narukara-san?

21:12.540 --> 21:13.620
Why?

21:13.620 --> 21:17.110
Um, Musen-san told me

21:17.110 --> 21:21.300
that it was really Akutagawa-kun
who protected me.

21:21.300 --> 21:23.010
So I came here...

21:23.940 --> 21:25.920
Ran told you that?

21:25.920 --> 21:28.750
She wanted me to give you this, too.

21:30.450 --> 21:34.170
Don't get the wrong idea.
An onee-sama is always fair.

21:34.170 --> 21:35.380
That's the only reason.

21:35.380 --> 21:36.480
P.S.

21:36.480 --> 21:38.940
You're still scum and an ero-writer,

21:38.940 --> 21:42.420
but I guess you might be
right for Fukune-chan...

21:42.420 --> 21:44.610
If not for me, and maybe
three or four others.

21:45.170 --> 21:46.780
<i>Ran...</i>

21:47.300 --> 21:48.280
Um...

21:48.280 --> 21:50.430
